{
  "_comment": "Claude Code, Anthropic's coding agent for the terminal, as a command line program per account. Claude Code is proprietary, and Anthropic's legal agreements govern its use; no release of Neutrino's carries it. One artifact per platform, the tarball of @anthropic-ai/claude-code-<platform>, Anthropic's npm package of the program for that platform; its source set is npm and its digest the integrity registry.npmjs.org names. The agent unpacks it without package/ into claude_code/package, where the program keeps the publisher's mode 755. The versions and their digests come from the npm feed of each platform's own package; the tested version is one of Anthropic's stable channel. Claude Code runs on macOS 13 or later and Windows 10 1809, build 17763, or later.",
  "name": "claude_code",
  "title": "Claude Code",
  "description": "Anthropic's coding agent on the command line, for each account",
  "publisher": "Anthropic",
  "uninstall_data": {
    "is_deleted": false,
    "text": {
      "en": "Each account's settings in ~/.claude stay, and so does a copy of Claude Code installed outside this module.",
      "zh-CN": "每个账户在 ~/.claude 里的设置都保留，在本模块之外安装的 Claude Code 也保留。"
    }
  },
